WEBVTT

00:13.000 --> 00:15.500
Leave Chinatown to follow me
and you shall live.

00:15.541 --> 00:17.416
Otherwise, you shall die.

00:20.125 --> 00:22.666
Since the bloody battle at Chinatown,

00:22.916 --> 00:24.250
security has been tightened.

00:24.500 --> 00:26.500
The eradication of rogues
has been accelerated.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.250
The era of territorial rivalry is over.

00:30.541 --> 00:32.875
Long, Phong, Ba

00:33.000 --> 00:36.125
withdrew from the criminal world
according to the wish of Hung Chinatown.

00:36.791 --> 00:39.500
The gangland at that time was a calm lake.

00:40.166 --> 00:42.750
Until someone tries to stir it up.

00:52.625 --> 00:55.250
The blood debt must be paid with blood.

00:57.375 --> 01:00.625
A storm coming from The North Port
stirs Chinatown once more.

01:48.750 --> 01:50.125
Ba!

01:50.625 --> 01:51.791
Ba!

03:01.750 --> 03:04.500
[Revenge]

03:20.791 --> 03:22.875
Give Ba back to me!

03:56.541 --> 03:58.625
Brothers forever.

04:10.875 --> 04:12.416
Any updates on Ky?

04:14.125 --> 04:16.750
All gateways have been raided.

04:17.125 --> 04:18.666
I think he's not out of town yet.

04:25.291 --> 04:27.375
Call Kim to ask if she knows anything.

04:27.916 --> 04:29.166
I will.

05:11.500 --> 05:12.750
What do you want?

05:13.125 --> 05:15.375
How dare you took Hai Cuong's side?

05:16.666 --> 05:18.166
Since the train station's matter,

05:18.375 --> 05:20.500
you've been taking my compliance
for granted.

05:21.625 --> 05:22.916
You want to kill me?

05:25.791 --> 05:28.250
You won't be able to flee
even if you kill me.

05:28.750 --> 05:30.250
Then let's die together.

05:51.166 --> 05:52.500
Nobody answered.

05:53.125 --> 05:54.375
I wonder if something's happened.

05:54.825 --> 05:56.099
Don't kill me.

05:57.329 --> 05:58.788
I can help you.

06:48.700 --> 06:52.659
Recently, a drug ring has been dismantled
with a large amount of goods.

06:52.684 --> 06:55.725
As per preliminary information,
Le Quy Ky is believed to be the leader.

06:55.750 --> 07:02.822
However, according to the project
committee, there is still a suspect behind…

07:07.350 --> 07:10.600
[Duong Van Ba, Date of Birth: 1970]

07:10.625 --> 07:14.208
[Peacefully passed away in 2000
at the age of 30 years old]

07:21.041 --> 07:25.291
We will exact justice on you, Ba.

07:51.541 --> 07:53.000
This is my fight.

07:53.375 --> 07:55.125
I don't want to involve everyone.

07:55.750 --> 07:57.291
I must take revenge.

07:57.375 --> 08:00.625
I'll leave Chinatown to you guys this time.

08:00.625 --> 08:02.125
No.

08:10.291 --> 08:11.875
This is all ours.

08:12.250 --> 08:13.875
Not yours only.

08:20.000 --> 08:21.416
I owe you guys this time.

08:22.375 --> 08:24.166
I will never forget this.

08:33.125 --> 08:34.500
Big brother.

08:39.875 --> 08:41.416
We want to join Chinatown again.

08:45.000 --> 08:46.291
Are you sure?

08:49.125 --> 08:50.791
The blood debt must be paid with blood.

09:10.750 --> 09:12.166
[Lieutenant Duong Van Hung]

09:41.416 --> 09:42.750
It's done, ma'am.

09:45.000 --> 09:46.666
- Here.
- Okay, thank you.

09:51.625 --> 09:53.000
Ms. Kim?

09:54.125 --> 09:55.375
Oh, you.

09:56.000 --> 09:57.416
Where are you heading to?

10:02.625 --> 10:04.250
Oh, I have a business nearby.

10:04.250 --> 10:05.625
It seems like you're working hard.

10:05.625 --> 10:06.791
It's my job.

10:06.875 --> 10:08.916
It's been a long time
I didn't see you come over.

10:09.375 --> 10:11.791
I'm pretty busy lately.
I'll visit you when I have time.

10:12.291 --> 10:13.375
Okay, I have to go now.

10:13.375 --> 10:15.291
- Okay, bye.
- Bye.

10:18.125 --> 10:19.500
- Excuse me!
- Yes, ma'am?

10:19.500 --> 10:20.750
Where is the toilet?

10:21.791 --> 10:23.291
This way, ma'am.

10:26.666 --> 10:28.250
Should I pee here?

11:01.041 --> 11:02.500
[Ky is traveling Southern...]

11:16.125 --> 11:17.416
Afraid of me running away?

11:26.819 --> 11:28.484
[Hai Cuong]

11:43.166 --> 11:44.500
What's wrong?

11:49.625 --> 11:51.500
[Ky is traveling Southern to escape
to Cambodia. Help me.]

11:54.125 --> 11:55.875
Gather everybody here for me.

11:59.166 --> 12:00.666
I'm listening.

13:20.000 --> 13:21.500
Look this way.

13:25.250 --> 13:27.625
Okay, done. Please wait for a while.

13:36.875 --> 13:38.916
Hien. Follow the plan.

13:39.000 --> 13:40.291
Yes.

13:44.541 --> 13:45.791
Hao!

13:46.125 --> 13:47.375
You must stay,

13:47.375 --> 13:48.750
in case something goes wrong.

14:06.291 --> 14:07.625
Oh no.

14:08.000 --> 14:10.791
I remember putting the phone here,
but where has it gone?

14:31.250 --> 14:32.625
Finish it.

14:56.875 --> 14:58.125
Kim.

14:59.875 --> 15:01.125
You're pretty,

15:02.666 --> 15:04.250
and sexy like this.

15:05.125 --> 15:06.791
It would be better if you were obedient.

15:25.541 --> 15:26.750
I'll do it.

15:38.500 --> 15:40.125
Phong.

15:45.625 --> 15:46.875
Long.

15:48.250 --> 15:49.375
What's wrong?

15:50.500 --> 15:51.875
Nothing.

15:55.875 --> 15:57.250
Let me.

16:09.250 --> 16:10.666
- Hello?
- Where are you?

16:11.875 --> 16:13.250
Take care of my mom.

16:15.375 --> 16:17.000
Phong! Phong!

16:32.000 --> 16:34.625
Kim!

16:36.916 --> 16:38.625
Hold on! Hold on!

16:38.875 --> 16:40.250
Kim!

16:59.375 --> 17:00.500
Hey! Running away?

19:22.875 --> 19:24.000
Hien!

20:45.115 --> 20:46.083
Big Brother!

20:46.279 --> 20:47.333
Catch him!

20:52.500 --> 20:53.791
Don't let him escape.

23:25.875 --> 23:27.125
Fuck you bastard.

23:29.166 --> 23:29.708
Long!

23:40.416 --> 23:41.791
Fuck you!

23:41.875 --> 23:43.875
- Let go of me!
- You're killing him!

23:44.125 --> 23:45.125
I'll kill him!

23:45.166 --> 23:47.125
I must take revenge for Ba!

23:47.166 --> 23:48.875
You'll go to jail if he dies!

25:09.541 --> 25:12.250
The image of the altar is not even decent.

25:13.625 --> 25:15.125
Don't joke around.

25:19.375 --> 25:21.625
I bet he would like it better
if I joked around.

25:24.375 --> 25:27.541
Where do you think he is now?

25:29.625 --> 25:31.166
In heaven, of course.

25:31.625 --> 25:32.875
Nope.

25:33.875 --> 25:35.416
He's in my heart.

26:33.875 --> 26:37.666
[End]

27:14.250 --> 27:17.125
Hai Cuong was blindsided by hatred,

27:18.416 --> 27:20.541
that caused us to lose a big catch.

27:22.750 --> 27:24.750
So the leader has escaped?

27:25.250 --> 27:26.500
He hasn't been caught yet.

27:28.125 --> 27:29.875
Ky is nothing but a front to sale drugs.

27:30.625 --> 27:33.375
The whole ring belongs to one man.

27:33.625 --> 27:34.750
Six Knots.

27:35.500 --> 27:36.666
How about Chinatown?

27:37.750 --> 27:39.000
Peaceful for now.

27:40.166 --> 27:43.125
But we can't predict what will happen next.

28:00.000 --> 28:02.750
[6 years later]

28:06.250 --> 28:09.000
Dad, I want to be a
gangster when I grow up.

28:09.041 --> 28:10.875
Hey, don’t be silly.

28:11.666 --> 28:14.166
Listen, gangster is a one-way road.

28:14.500 --> 28:16.250
You cannot turn around once you enter it.

28:16.250 --> 28:17.291
Am I right, Hung?

28:18.541 --> 28:22.500
Why are you keeping me
wearing this wig? It's hot like hell.

28:22.625 --> 28:26.000
Well, the wig makes
you look like your father.

28:26.125 --> 28:27.375
Just think of it as a hat.
